flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> MAIN[call_model<br/>Main Agent]
    MAIN -->|write_plan / update_plan / ls / query_note| TOOLS[tools ToolNode]
    TOOLS --> MAIN
    MAIN -->|transfor_task_to_subagent| SUB[subagent subgraph]

    SUB --> SUBMODEL[subagent_call_model]
    SUBMODEL -->|query_note / search_legal_cases / get_case_detail| SUBTOOLS[sub_tools ToolNode]
    SUBTOOLS --> SUBMODEL
    SUBMODEL -->|write_note| WAS[write_and_summary subgraph]
    WAS --> WRITE[write note]
    WAS --> SUMMARY[generate ToolMessage summary]
    WRITE --> SUBEND([Subgraph END])
    SUMMARY --> SUBEND
    SUBMODEL -->|no tool call| SUBEND

    SUBEND --> MAIN
    MAIN -->|no tool call / final response| END([END])
